# Inventaire des scripts ZenRay Meshes

Rédigé le 28 October 2026.

Source : /Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-zenray-meshes/recap/scripts_docstrings.txt (2515 lignes, 140 en-têtes lus en entier).
Dossier inventorié : /Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-meshes/scripts (racine, archetypes, curverig, finish, retopo).
